    "description": "The Hotel Loyalty Points History API provides access to the historical records of loyalty points earned and redeemed by members of the hotel loyalty program. This endpoint enables users to retrieve detailed information about their loyalty transactions, including dates, point changes, and relevant activities. It is particularly useful for loyalty program members who want to track their points over time and gain insights into their loyalty activities. Typical consumers of this API include mobile application developers and web developers looking to integrate loyalty features into their platforms.",
